son><in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement2">Mandar Joshi</in-capmkt:NameOfDesignatedPerson><in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange contextRef="I_ChangeInManagement2">2026-10-01</in-capmkt:EffectiveDateOfReasonOfChange><in-capmkt:BriefProfile contextRef="D_ChangeInManagement2">Mr. Mandar Joshi is Management professional with 20+ years of leadership experience spanning Treasury and Corporate Strategy in financial services sector. 
Mr. Mandar Joshi has been associated with the Company since 2007 and currently serves as Executive Vice President – Treasury at the Company. He has an extensive experience as senior treasury leader in shaping liability strategy, fund-raising across domestic and international markets and anchoring key institutional relationships at the Company. 
Prior to Tata Capital, he has worked with Tata Motors Limited.

He holds a Post Graduate Diploma in Management (Finance and Strategy) from Indian Institute of Management, Calcutta and a Bachelor’s degree in Mechanical Engineering from Sardar Patel College of Engineering, Mumbai. He is also a Fulbright Scholar in Leadership and Innovation from Carnegie Mellon University and has completed Leadership Programs from Harvard Business School and the Indian School of Business.
</in-capmkt:BriefProfile></xbrli:xbrl>
